Subject: [PATCH] World campaign: finish the GCO rename in the read-me and the
 regional test

The three WORLD-CAMPAIGN-READ-ME.txt copies still named the campaign
Global Strategic Command Operations (GSCO), and test_regional_expansion
still expected that name while campaign.json says Global Command
Operations (GCO), so the test failed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PqVgEz2BqXRqNYjz7JVMj3
---
