 .../SEST_World_Campaign/WORLD-CAMPAIGN-READ-ME.txt              | 2 +-
 integration/world-sandbox/WORLD-CAMPAIGN-READ-ME.txt            | 2 +-
 tools/tests/test_regional_expansion.py                          | 2 +-
 4 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/integration/dist/SEST_Integration/WORLD-CAMPAIGN-READ-ME.txt b/integration/dist/SEST_Integration/WORLD-CAMPAIGN-READ-ME.txt
index be9b9fe1a..debd8bbb2 100644
--- a/integration/dist/SEST_Integration/WORLD-CAMPAIGN-READ-ME.txt
+++ b/integration/dist/SEST_Integration/WORLD-CAMPAIGN-READ-ME.txt
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@ regional expansion: 196 bases, 293 forces, 54 patrols and 1,664 buy entries.
 This is a fictional scenario; deployments and alliances are design choices.
 Open Campaigns and choose the [Dynamic] entry. The world begins in October
 2028 and uses Bungalow's Dynamic Campaign Mod. SEST develops the weather and
-integration systems under the name Global Strategic Command Operations (GSCO).
+integration systems under the name Global Command Operations (GCO).
 Use a new game for the full revised layout. Dynamic Campaign Mod 1.0.1
 can reopen a 1.0.x world save. Worlds from 0.25 and earlier need a new game.
 
